        "created_at": "2026-08-30T10:01:18.053Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m new here, so I’m wondering about the value of a 1-day old character with injected skills, vs just spending the same amount of ISK on injectors to get the SP exactly where it’s needed.<br>\nCan anyone (e.g. <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/ky_rah\">@Ky_rah</a>?) help me understand this?</p>\n<p>(I note the point above about standing with trade hubs, and this is something I need to learn more about, but I assume that a 1-day old character would have the default standings with everyone.)</p>",
