        "cooked": "<p>So when buying or selling a character, real money is involved.  It costs the person selling $20 real money to transfer character to another account..<br>\nSo most people want to “make that back” by selling at a somewhat higher price than suggested… typically if its less than 5 million sp, its generally not worth to sell it, as it will only sell for 3-4 bil.</p>\n<p>long time ago, before injectors/extractors the price used to be for every mil SP, it would cost 1 bil to buy.</p>\n<p>considering this alt only has 1.5 mil sp, it will never sell enough for them to make the isk back..</p>\n<p>if this was a legacy character from early 2000’s it would sell as there are some people that want characters from that era.</p>",
        "post_number": 9,
